        "id": "i",
        "text": "Which claim about the dot plot is correct?",
        "marks": 1,
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "A",
            "text": "The plot shows values $2$, $5$ and $7$, with frequency $2$ at $2$, frequency $2$ at $5$, and frequency $1$ at $7$; the minimum is $2$, the maximum is $7$, and the range is $5$."
