          {
            "id": "B",
            "text": "The plot keeps the original quiz order $1$ through $5$ as labels on the dots."
          },
          {
            "id": "C",
            "text": "The number line is what comes from first drawing the finished dot plot."
          },
          {
            "id": "D",
            "text": "The plot shows only the single value $5$, because $5$ appears most often in the stem."
